   "notes": "Selected fixed-K0'=4 BM3 fit: the published Z=1 V0=45.6(2) A^3 is stored as 182.4(8) A^3 for the conventional Z=4 I4/mcm cell, while K0=229(4) GPa is unchanged. The direct 300 K P-V data span 21.5-199.2 GPa; routine use is intentionally limited to 30-150 GPa. Table 1 combines 14 Sun et al. (2016) quenched observations reanalyzed on the common Pt scale with nine new 2022 observations. The paper does not publish parameter covariance or a confidence convention for the parenthetical errors. An unweighted pressure-residual refit reproduces both the free- and fixed-K0' Table 2 alternatives after rounding.",
